# Funcionario workflow

Read `.cursor/knowledge/frontend-base/workflow.md` before changing a funcionario task page.

Stay inside the procedure list in that file. A procedure number that is not in the list is out of scope. Do not write a page body for it.

The registro wizard (Capturar solicitud, Anexar requisitos, Firmar solicitud) is a different flow.

A file inside `tramites/<procedure>/` may be edited directly.

These six folders may also be edited directly. The parent evaluar page around them is not one of them and still needs Allow:

- `Project/frontend/apps/agricultura/src/app/application/evaluar/components_220102`
- `Project/frontend/apps/agricultura/src/app/application/evaluar/components_220103`
- `Project/frontend/apps/agricultura/src/app/application/evaluar/components_221601`
- `Project/frontend/apps/agace/src/app/application/evaluar/dictamen317`
- `Project/frontend/apps/agace/src/app/application/evaluar/dictamen-31803`
- `Project/frontend/apps/aga/src/app/application/evaluar/dictamen-303`

Ask Allow before editing `Project/frontend/libs/shared` (the inbox, ConsultaioStore, app-reviewers-tabs, solicitante, app-generar-dictamen, firma-electronica, and the wizard buttons) or a department task shell outside `tramites/<procedure>/`: evaluar, verificar-dictamen, autorizar-dictamen, autorizar-requerimiento, confirmar-notificacion, proceso-requerimiento, atender-requerimiento, and tramiteConfig.service.ts. Wait for Allow. Do not edit that file before the user chooses Allow.
